*> vybe-test: cobol/cobol2023_nested/perform_thru_sections_runtime_total
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_cobol2023_nested.rs

IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
01 WS-COUNTER PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    PERFORM INIT-PARA THRU CLEANUP-PARA.
    DISPLAY WS-COUNTER.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-COUNTER DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "111"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [111] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.
INIT-PARA.
    ADD 1 TO WS-COUNTER.
PROCESS-PARA.
    ADD 10 TO WS-COUNTER.
CLEANUP-PARA.
    ADD 100 TO WS-COUNTER.

